\pard\plain \tx0\tx360\tx720\tx1080\tx1440\tx1800\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\fi360\ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Wendy,  Quinton and David made there way through the forest. Each caring there backpacks full of camping gear. It would be dark soon and they hoped to make camp before then. }
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 How did you say you found this place Wendy?}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 I told you David, I was walking Butters when she ran into the woods chasing a squirrel or a bird or who know what.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 You need to get that dog train.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Thank you Quinton, Wendy said sarcastically}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Anyway Butters took off and I ran after her until I got to this open field next to a river.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 It\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92s the perfect place to film in unexplored territory. That was the problem with going to film school in a small town. Nature shoots are beautiful. Everyone filmed at the same locations. }
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 This is gonna be great spending time in nature. Nothing like peace and quite to get your creative juices flowing.}
